{"id":"f2a6240dd17a4197","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-thm-alarcon-forster.md","title":"Complete Proper Curves in a Ball","display":"thm-alarcon-forster — Complete Proper Curves in a Ball","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-alarcon-forster","aliases":["58-thm-alarcon-forster","58-thm-alarcon-forrster"],"display":"thm-alarcon-forster — Complete Proper Curves in a Ball","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-riemann-surface.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-holomorphic.md]]","[[58-df-immersion.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-injective.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-topo11-proper-map.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-complete-metric.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-ball.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-alarcon-forster"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-alarcon-forster</span><span>58-thm-alarcon-forrster</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-alarcon-forster — Complete Proper Curves in a Ball"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"40b3e2c20a74165b\" href=\"?note=40b3e2c20a74165b\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-riemann-surface.md\">../batch05/58-df-riemann-surface.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2e27b623be13cf38\" href=\"?note=2e27b623be13cf38\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-holomorphic.md\">../batch20/58-df-holomorphic.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7056a4392f2b25e2\" href=\"?note=7056a4392f2b25e2\" title=\"58-df-immersion.md\">58-df-immersion.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8317eefb4572709e\" href=\"?note=8317eefb4572709e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-injective.md\">../batch15/58-df-injective.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8991e2677563aa6b\" href=\"?note=8991e2677563aa6b\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-topo11-proper-map.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-topo11-proper-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"05d80cd20b53d8a2\" href=\"?note=05d80cd20b53d8a2\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-complete-metric.md\">../batch10/58-df-complete-metric.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c0dd9ffea872a14a\" href=\"?note=c0dd9ffea872a14a\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-ball.md\">../batch03/58-df-ball.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,F,G,D_F,D_G,T_M,T_2,T_3\\in V\">\\(M,F,G,D_F,D_G,T_M,T_2,T_3\\in V\\)</span>, where <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> is a bordered Riemann surface with interior <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathring M\">\\(\\mathring M\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B^n=\\{z\\in\\mathbb C^n:\\|z\\|&lt;1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B^n=\\{z\\in\\mathbb C^n:\\|z\\|&lt;1\\}\\)</span> (unit ball)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_M,\\tau_{\\mathbb B^2},\\tau_{\\mathbb B^3}\">\\(\\tau_M,\\tau_{\\mathbb B^2},\\tau_{\\mathbb B^3}\\)</span> (topologies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_{\\mathrm{Euc}}\">\\(d_{\\mathrm{Euc}}\\)</span> (Euclidean metric)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BorderedRiemannSurface}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(M,\\mathring M,\\tau_M)\">\\(\\mathrm{BorderedRiemannSurface}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(M,\\mathring M,\\tau_M)\\)</span> is the standard compact bordered-surface predicate, kept at the metalevel because no manifold-with-boundary atom exists</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HolomorphicMap}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(F;X,Y)\">\\(\\mathrm{HolomorphicMap}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(F;X,Y)\\)</span> is the standard chartwise holomorphic-map predicate between complex manifolds</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ImmersionData}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{ImmersionData}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injective}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Injective}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> are the cited set-level map predicates</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11ProperMap}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11ProperMap}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteMetric}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteMetric}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}alarcon\\text{-}forster}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BorderedRiemannSurface}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(M,\\mathring M,\\tau_M)\n\\to\n\\exists F,G,D_F,D_G,T_M,T_2,T_3\\in V\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\mathring M,\\mathbb B^2)\n\\land\\mathrm{HolomorphicMap}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(F;\\mathring M,\\mathbb B^2)\n\\land\\mathrm{ImmersionData}_S(F,\\mathring M,\\mathbb B^2,D_F,T_M,T_2)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11ProperMap}_S\n(F,\\mathring M,\\tau_M,\\mathbb B^2,\\tau_{\\mathbb B^2})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{CompleteMetric}_S(\\mathring M,F^*d_{\\mathrm{Euc}})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(G,\\mathring M,\\mathbb B^3)\n\\land\\mathrm{HolomorphicMap}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(G;\\mathring M,\\mathbb B^3)\n\\land\\mathrm{ImmersionData}_S(G,\\mathring M,\\mathbb B^3,D_G,T_M,T_3)\n\\land\\mathrm{Injective}(G,\\mathring M,\\mathbb B^3)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11ProperMap}_S\n(G,\\mathring M,\\tau_M,\\mathbb B^3,\\tau_{\\mathbb B^3})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{CompleteMetric}_S(\\mathring M,G^*d_{\\mathrm{Euc}})\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}alarcon\\text{-}forster}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BorderedRiemannSurface}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(M,\\mathring M,\\tau_M)\n\\to\n\\exists F,G,D_F,D_G,T_M,T_2,T_3\\in V\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\mathring M,\\mathbb B^2)\n\\land\\mathrm{HolomorphicMap}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(F;\\mathring M,\\mathbb B^2)\n\\land\\mathrm{ImmersionData}_S(F,\\mathring M,\\mathbb B^2,D_F,T_M,T_2)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11ProperMap}_S\n(F,\\mathring M,\\tau_M,\\mathbb B^2,\\tau_{\\mathbb B^2})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{CompleteMetric}_S(\\mathring M,F^*d_{\\mathrm{Euc}})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(G,\\mathring M,\\mathbb B^3)\n\\land\\mathrm{HolomorphicMap}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(G;\\mathring M,\\mathbb B^3)\n\\land\\mathrm{ImmersionData}_S(G,\\mathring M,\\mathbb B^3,D_G,T_M,T_3)\n\\land\\mathrm{Injective}(G,\\mathring M,\\mathbb B^3)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11ProperMap}_S\n(G,\\mathring M,\\tau_M,\\mathbb B^3,\\tau_{\\mathbb B^3})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{CompleteMetric}_S(\\mathring M,G^*d_{\\mathrm{Euc}})\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb C^2\">\\(\\mathbb C^2\\)</span> map is a complete proper holomorphic immersion; in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb C^3\">\\(\\mathbb C^3\\)</span> it can be chosen to be an embedding.</li>\n<li>Holomorphicity is typed with both source and target complex manifolds; the one-variable predicate for maps between planar open sets is not used here.</li>\n<li>The missing manifold-with-boundary and unequal-dimension holomorphic-map notions are marked explicitly as metatheoretic instead of being assigned fabricated set-level signatures.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A. Alarcón and F. Forstnerič, <em>Every bordered Riemann surface is a complete proper curve in a ball</em> (2013).</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-riemann-surface.md","status":"resolved","id":"40b3e2c20a74165b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-riemann-surface.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-holomorphic.md","status":"resolved","id":"2e27b623be13cf38","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-holomorphic.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-immersion.md","status":"resolved","id":"7056a4392f2b25e2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-immersion.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-injective.md","status":"resolved","id":"8317eefb4572709e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-injective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-topo11-proper-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"8991e2677563aa6b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-topo11-proper-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-complete-metric.md","status":"resolved","id":"05d80cd20b53d8a2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-complete-metric.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-ball.md","status":"resolved","id":"c0dd9ffea872a14a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-ball.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,F,G,D_F,D_G,T_M,T_2,T_3\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathring M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B^n=\\{z\\in\\mathbb C^n:\\|z\\|<1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_M,\\tau_{\\mathbb B^2},\\tau_{\\mathbb B^3}","display":false},{"tex":"d_{\\mathrm{Euc}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BorderedRiemannSurface}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(M,\\mathring M,\\tau_M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HolomorphicMap}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(F;X,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ImmersionData}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Injective}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11ProperMap}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompleteMetric}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}alarcon\\text{-}forster}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BorderedRiemannSurface}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(M,\\mathring M,\\tau_M)\n\\to\n\\exists F,G,D_F,D_G,T_M,T_2,T_3\\in V\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\mathring M,\\mathbb B^2)\n\\land\\mathrm{HolomorphicMap}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(F;\\mathring M,\\mathbb B^2)\n\\land\\mathrm{ImmersionData}_S(F,\\mathring M,\\mathbb B^2,D_F,T_M,T_2)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11ProperMap}_S\n(F,\\mathring M,\\tau_M,\\mathbb B^2,\\tau_{\\mathbb B^2})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{CompleteMetric}_S(\\mathring M,F^*d_{\\mathrm{Euc}})\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(G,\\mathring M,\\mathbb B^3)\n\\land\\mathrm{HolomorphicMap}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(G;\\mathring M,\\mathbb B^3)\n\\land\\mathrm{ImmersionData}_S(G,\\mathring M,\\mathbb B^3,D_G,T_M,T_3)\n\\land\\mathrm{Injective}(G,\\mathring M,\\mathbb B^3)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11ProperMap}_S\n(G,\\mathring M,\\tau_M,\\mathbb B^3,\\tau_{\\mathbb B^3})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{CompleteMetric}_S(\\mathring M,G^*d_{\\mathrm{Euc}})\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb C^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb C^3","display":false}],"bytes":3051,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4022","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-thm-alarcon-forster.md|58-thm-alarcon-forster]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["40b3e2c20a74165b","2e27b623be13cf38","7056a4392f2b25e2","8317eefb4572709e","8991e2677563aa6b","05d80cd20b53d8a2","c0dd9ffea872a14a","36d7463d215be751"]}